        "path": "python_programs/find_first_in_sorted.py",
        "new_content": "def find_first_in_sorted(arr, x):\n    lo = 0\n    hi = len(arr) - 1\n\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n\n        if x == arr[mid] and (mid == 0 or x != arr[mid - 1]):\n            return mid\n\n        elif x < arr[mid]:\n            hi = mid - 1\n        elif x == arr[mid]:\n            hi = mid - 1\n\n        else:\n            lo = mid + 1\n\n    return -1\n\n\n\"\"\"\nFancy Binary Search\nfancy-binsearch\n\n\nInput:\n    arr: A sorted list of ints\n    x: A value to find\n\nOutput:\n    The lowest index i such that arr[i] == x, or -1 if x not in arr\n\nExample:\n    >>> find_first_in_sorted([3, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 6], 5)\n    2\n\"\"\"\n"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "原循环在 x <= arr[mid] 时设置 hi = mid，当 mid 不再变化时导致无限循环/超时（特别是 x 等于 arr[mid] 但不是第一个出现位置，或 x 小于 arr[mid] 时仍需收缩）。修正为：当 x < arr[mid] 时 hi = mid - 1；当 x == arr[mid] 但不是首个出现位置时，同样将 hi 收缩为 mid - 1 以继续向左搜索首个索引。保持接口和语义不变。",
